<title>GERMANY: Walter Bau says 96 profits won't reach 95 levels.</title>
<headline>Walter Bau says 96 profits won't reach 95 levels.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>German construction group Walter Bau-AG said on Wednesday that profits in 1996 would not be as high as those from 1995.</p>
<p>The company also said that 1996 building output climbed to 4.5 billion marks from 4.0 billion marks.</p>
<p>Walter Bau also said it had been hurt by a difficult construction environment which it did not expect to improve in 1997.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
